  {
   "url": "https://www.mass.gov/locations/francis-d-martini-memorial-shell-park-and-moynihan-recreation-area",
   "status": 200,
   "final_url": "https://www.mass.gov/locations/francis-d-martini-memorial-shell-park-and-moynihan-recreation-area",
   "title": "Francis D. Martini Memorial Shell Park and Moynihan Recreation Area | Mass.gov",
   "text": "An official website of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts\nHere's how you know\nSkip to main content\nMenu\nLanguage\nState Organizations\nMass.gov\nSearch terms\nSEARCH\nParks & Recreation Visit Massachusetts State Parks\nFrancis D. Martini Memorial Shell Park and Moynihan Recreation Area\nTHIS PAGE, FRANCIS D. MARTINI MEMORIAL SHELL PARK AND MOYNIHAN RECREATION AREA, IS\nOFFERED BY\nDepartment of Conservation & Recreation\nFrancis D. Martini Memorial Shell Park and Moynihan Recreation Area\nAddress\n1015 Truman Parkway, Boston, MA 02136\nDirections\nPhone\n(617) 698-1802\nTRANSIT FRIENDLY\nDOGS ALLOWED\nJohn T. Moynihan Spray Deck\nGet Directions\nto Francis D. Martini Memorial Shell Park and Moynihan Recreation Area in Google Maps\nDETAILS\nOverview\nHours\nParking\nAll Activities\nFacilities\nRestrictions\nOverview\nThere's plenty of grass on which to sit and relax during concert or performance at the Martini Memorial Shell Head. Across the street at the Moynihan Recreation Area, you'll find athletic fields, a playground, and a spray deck.\nHours\nSunrise to sunset\nParking\nFree parking available in lot.\nAll Activities\nTennis\nBaseball\nBasketball\nCanoeing and kayaking\nBiking\nConcerts\nFacilities\nAmphitheater\nAthletic fields\nBall courts\nBoat ramp\nPaved bike paths\nPicnic area\nPlayground\nScenic viewing area\nSpray deck\nRestrictions\nNo alcohol\nNo littering\nMore parks\nVisit Massachusetts State Parks Locations\nHelp Us Improve Mass.gov\nwith your feedback\nDid you find what you were looking for on this webpage?\nYes\nNo\nMass.gov\nState Organizations\nDigital Accessibility Statement\nPrivacy Policy\nSite Policies\nPublic Records Requests\n© 2026 Commonwealth of Massachusetts.\nMass.gov® is a registered service mark of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts.\nFeedback",
